BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mean Streets (1973)
DTSTART:20260226T033000Z
DTEND:20260226T054000Z
DTSTAMP:20260226T033000Z
UID:in1G3CkEeC
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 112 mins (1h52m)\n\nMartin Scorsese: Maestro of Cine
 ma Feel a dazzling rush of cinematic vitality and dark humor as a young ma
 n (Harvey Keitel)\, split between the rough world around him and his spiri
 tual nature\, tries to keep his loose cannon friend (Robert De Niro) and h
 is girlfriend (Amy Robinson) safe from street toughs and Mob bosses. Inspi
 red by Scorsese’s Little Italy background.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/progr
 ams-and-events/martin-scorsese/mean-streets\n\nEstimated start: 19:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Taxi Driver (1976)
DTSTART:20260305T033000Z
DTEND:20260305T054000Z
DTSTAMP:20260305T033000Z
UID:l4bNIDFSpW
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 114 mins (1h54m)\n\nMartin Scorsese: Maestro of Cine
 ma He’s (Robert De Niro) an alienated\, lonely man in an urban snake pit
 \, who sees himself as “an avenging angel” capable of heroic action\, 
 like saving a teen prostitute (Jodie Foster) from her sleazy pimp (Harvey 
 Keitel). People with“bad ideas” in the city of night. 50th anniversar
 y screening.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/martin-scorsese/t
 axi-driver\n\nEstimated start: 19:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Raging Bull (1980)
DTSTART:20260312T023000Z
DTEND:20260312T045500Z
DTSTAMP:20260312T023000Z
UID:J1Iuo5SK1o
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 129 mins (2h09m)\n\nMartin Scorsese: Maestro of Cine
 ma A skilled boxer’s (Robert De Niro) anger serves him well in the ring\
 , but it threatens his relations with his brother (Joe Pesci)\, his new wi
 fe (Cathy Moriarty) and the Mafia\, which wants to control his career. Fig
 ht sequences as poetic ecstasy.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-event
 s/martin-scorsese/raging-bull\n\nEstimated start: 19:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The King of Comedy (1982)
DTSTART:20260319T023000Z
DTEND:20260319T043500Z
DTSTAMP:20260319T023000Z
UID:nkvxlDMMbx
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 109 mins (1h49m)\n\nMartin Scorsese: Maestro of Cine
 ma Mediocre comedian (Robert De Niro) dreams of being on the Comedy King
 ’s (Jerry Lewis) TV show. Maybe his chances would improve if he and his 
 friend (Sandra Bernhard) kidnapped his idol. Delightfully cringey.\n\nhttp
 s://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/martin-scorsese/the-king-of-comedy\n\
 nEstimated start: 19:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
